'''Hariyama''' (Japanese: '''ハリテヤマ''' ''Hariteyama'') is a {{ct|Fighting}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Crimson Blaze}} expansion.

