==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|EX Ruby & Sapphire|Hariyama|8}} from the {{TCG|EX Ruby & Sapphire}} expansion.
*'''Megaton Slap Push''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Sun & Moon|Hariyama|68}} from the {{TCG|Sun & Moon}} expansion.
